@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_LuisIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_LuisIntro::
	.string "Whew! I was worried that a kid was\n"
	.string "drowning when I saw you.\p"
	.string "You seem to be okay, so what do you\n"
	.string "say to a battle?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_LuisDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_LuisDefeated::
	.string "Glub… Glub…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_LuisPostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_LuisPostBattle::
	.string "If you are drowning, the signal is to\n"
	.string "wave one arm toward the beach.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_DominikIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_DominikIntro::
	.string "Swimming the deep blue sea…\n"
	.string "It feels the greatest!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_DominikDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_DominikDefeated::
	.string "I lost…\n"
	.string "Now I'm feeling blue…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_DominikPostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_DominikPostBattle::
	.string "Why is the sea blue?\p"
	.string "I learned about that at the MUSEUM in\n"
	.string "SLATEPORT, but I forgot.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_BeverlyIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_BeverlyIntro::
	.string "My body feels lighter in the water.\n"
	.string "It's as if I've gotten slimmer!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_BeverlyDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_BeverlyDefeated::
	.string "I'm floating…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_PostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_PostBattle::
	.string "Your body weight is reduced to just\n"
	.string "one tenth in the water.\p"
	.string "That would make me…\n"
	.string "Whoops! I'm not telling you my weight!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_ImaniIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_ImaniIntro::
	.string "The blue, blue sky…\n"
	.string "The vast sea…\l"
	.string "It's so peaceful…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_ImaniDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_ImaniDefeated::
	.string "I lost while I was lounging!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_ImaniPostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_ImaniPostBattle::
	.string "I want to be told I'm relaxing to be\n"
	.string "with. Giggle.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_FosterIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_FosterIntro::
	.string "There's supposed to be a mystical\n"
	.string "rock around here.\l"
	.string "Do you know anything about it?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_FosterDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_FosterDefeated::
	.string "I was thinking too much about that\n"
	.string "rock, while my POKéMON remained weak…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_FosterPostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_FosterPostBattle::
	.string "I can spend hours and hours staring\n"
	.string "at a nice rock without growing bored.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_JosueIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_JosueIntro::
	.string "I'm exhausted from swimming.\n"
	.string "I'm just not used to it.\p"
	.string "I need a battle for a change of pace!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_JosueDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_JosueDefeated::
	.string "I lost because I battled at sea.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_JosuePostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_JosuePostBattle::
	.string "Yeah, for me, the sky is a much better\n"
	.string "match than the sea.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_AndresIntro
Hoenn_Route105_Text_AndresIntro::
	.string "I'm convinced that the sea keeps\n"
	.string "secrets from us.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_AndresDefeated
Hoenn_Route105_Text_AndresDefeated::
	.string "Yes…\n"
	.string "I am no good at battling…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route105_Text_AndresPostBattle
Hoenn_Route105_Text_AndresPostBattle::
	.string "I'm sure there are many secrets to be\n"
	.string "discovered in the world's seas.\p"
	.string "I mean to find them all!$"
